Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}On the Road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 17
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Will the new challenger win?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it the victory of the previous championship?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.02,0:00:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The game has been decided
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is No. 99 Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.95,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well we won
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it you who gave me food just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks to an old man who looks like Slowy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The vehicle is in hand. Go find Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Done
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that the prize vehicle is actually a vehicle that is almost broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, it can still run after repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.17,0:01:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go find Xiao Mei now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess Xiao Mei was taken far away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.17,0:01:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,what to do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.45,0:01:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She can’t run far
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.00,0:01:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect her to show up so soon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and tell me what happened next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, the boss is asking you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She hurt us and then took away our treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he took the girl and ran to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it’s her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, that’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She uses Sand Shadow on her hand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for your message
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.31,0:02:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The grudge between you and me, Cha Erlang, should be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that? He seems to be going after Blue Scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.55,0:02:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just follow them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can find Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t they say set off? Why did they run into the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s bigger than Sirius
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Set off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,we chase
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.21,0:02:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Weslie and Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.57,0:03:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, hurry up to find them faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is my Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Weslie first and then talk about it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Move quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, turn sharply to the right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.91,0:03:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally caught up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,full speed ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.71,0:04:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, scrapped vehicles cannot be put on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.99,0:04:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They never stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the vehicle suddenly break down? Where is the engineer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.80,0:04:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The engineer has slipped out of the bubble
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you get him back quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.47,0:04:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,yes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Their vehicle is also broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.79,0:04:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,With that kind of impact, it’s no wonder it’s damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.67,0:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we help them fix their vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and then ask for a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even fix this kind of vehicle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you know if you don’t try?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.08,0:04:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.99,0:05:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We know your vehicle broke down
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So we want to help you fix your vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we hope you can take us with you to find Blue Scarf
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we also want to deal with her
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy of my enemy is my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.35,0:05:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, they were the ones who stole the vehicle and Xiao Mei back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t believe them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.98,0:05:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you spoil my good deeds? Drag them down to feed the fish
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did the fish come from in the desert?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There really is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.71,0:05:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally caught up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slow, Weslie and Wolffy are in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie here I come
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy it’s your old friend
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,let us go
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, throw them down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, the engineer is unconscious
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.74,0:06:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and won’t wake up for a while
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.90,0:06:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help you fix your vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, he has actually helped us repair our vehicle before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.27,0:06:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we make use of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,About to be eaten
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend will stay here for now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If it can’t be repaired within an hour, then feed him to the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.36,0:06:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Weslie has to be with me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The clock has started
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy I believe you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.03,0:06:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,These devices are too complicated, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, the engineer just stepped on the bubble and slipped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,During the time I’ve been here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re the first person to remember my name
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, how do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to explain now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’re here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.90,0:07:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize these devices? Tell me quickly how to fix them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you have asked the right person. My second uncle once told me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If something is broken, just pat it and it’ll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,stop
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d better do it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:07:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,All right
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After researching for a long time, I feel like there is just something wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s missing here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please stop disturbing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry. No one has taken the initiative to talk to me since I joined until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They all dislike me for always making mistakes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, I was assigned to clean the vehicle
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s why I want to help you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So there are so many bubbles here because you clean them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, everyone has a place to shine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.41,0:08:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you work hard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone will notice you one day
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:08:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,real
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you see this part, under your cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How sparkling it has become
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally discovered by you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.70,0:09:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will disassemble every part here and clean it carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do everything well
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.81,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can definitely become the boss’s most trusted subordinate
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Missing parts found
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.30,0:09:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But it turns out it was all because of you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be nice if I could rescue Weslie anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, no time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like your friend is not very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.99,0:09:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You will fall when the time is up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just plug the parts back in and you’ll be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.13,0:10:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Being conscientious, I washed the inside too
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,10
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,9
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,8
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,7
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.29,0:10:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,5
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie I made it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve got some skills, haven’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to scare us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared our driver earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t I take the opportunity to take revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.97,0:11:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you helped us again, let’s go on the road together
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.93,0:11:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally we can continue on the road
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,boss, to prevent fraud
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you ask them why they are also chasing Blue Scarf?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to ask. Everyone has different reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to delve into it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do? What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, let us go save Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have other tasks scheduled
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have to divide into two teams and set off
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, Mr. Slowy Let me save Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi, why are you so eager this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Mr. Slowy gave me this new weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t wait to try it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, then let me go with Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.79,0:12:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Wolffy, I’ll leave it to you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.21,0:12:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Paddi, Brother Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,come on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s our turn to show off our skills
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
